{"url": "https://x.com/MarioNawfal/status/2118606811351876073", "id": "2118606811351876073", "text": "Grok Bot can now find you a GOOD DOCTOR and book the appointment itself.\n\nIncluding dealing with the receptionist. Hallelujah.\n\nTell Bot what kind of specialist you need. It'll research doctors nearby, compare options, and figure out who's worth calling.\n\nIt picks up the phone, checks availability, asks about insurance, and gets the appointment arranged. Intake forms and calendar booking included.\n\nYou just show up for the appointment. Unfortunately, Grok Bot can't do the check-up for you.\n\n@Grok @Bot @spacexai / Writer: Annette, Designer: Jann\u00e9", "raw_text": {"text": "Grok Bot can now find you a GOOD DOCTOR and book the appointment itself.\n\nIncluding dealing with the receptionist. Hallelujah.\n\nTell Bot what kind of specialist you need. It'll research doctors nearby, compare options, and figure out who's worth calling.\n\nIt picks up the phone, checks availability, asks about insurance, and gets the appointment arranged. Intake forms and calendar booking included.\n\nYou just show up for the appointment. Unfortunately, Grok Bot can't do the check-up for you.\n\n@Grok @Bot @spacexai / Writer: Annette, Designer: Jann\u00e9", "display_text_range": [0, 551], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [279, 302], "id": "2118574899467825152", "display": "pic.x.com/m3I6cMEPx0", "original": "https://t.co/m3I6cMEPx0", "replacement": "https://x.com/MarioNawfal/status/2118606811351876073/video/1"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [496, 501], "original": "Grok", "id": "1720665183188922368"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [502, 506], "original": "Bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [507, 516], "original": "spacexai", "id": "1661523610111193088"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "MarioNawfal", "url": "https://x.com/MarioNawfal", "id": "1319287761048723458", "followers": 3979367, "following": 51689, "likes": 164828, "media_count": 219208,